        "These terms apply to Car Comfort service providers (drivers) who accept and perform valet EV charging and car wash jobs through the provider app. Use this page for help with onboarding, payouts, active jobs, and account issues. How to reach provider support Open the in-app Support section from provider settings and include your booking ID or payout reference when available. Email support is also available through the address shown in the app. What we can help with Onboarding, document review, and approval status • Payout timing, missing earnings, or Stripe Connect setup • Issues during an active service or customer handoff • Account deactivation or reinstatement questions • Reporting safety incidents on a job • Response times We prioritize active job and payout issues during U.S. business hours. Complex cases may take additional time while we review logs and booking records."
