        "Call Support 1-800-702-3590",
        "Car Comfort is America's first on-demand valet EV charging and car wash service provider, created to save you time and provide convenience without interrupting your daily schedules. This page applies to the Car Comfort mobile app and related services. If you need help with bookings, payments, your account, or a completed service, our support team is ready to assist. How to reach us Use the in-app Help or Support section to send a message with your booking details when possible. You can also email our support response inbox (shared separately in app settings and API metadata). Including screenshots or booking IDs helps us resolve issues faster. Email support For account, billing, and service questions, use the configured support response email for your environment. We aim to reply during U.S. business hours. What we can help with Scheduling or rescheduling valet EV charging and car wash visits • Questions about charges or receipts • Account and notification settings • Feedback on your experience • Reporting safety or service concerns • Response times We aim to respond as soon as possible during business hours (U.S. time zones). Complex cases may require additional investigation; we will keep you updated when a resolution is in progress.",
